  "description": "Meringue is a refined and elegant fragrance that blends bright citrus fruits with creamy woods and soft musky warmth. Despite its name, it is not a sugary gourmand—rather, it leans sophisticated, smooth, and slightly leathery with a clean modern finish. The opening introduces a vibrant mix of pineapple, mandarin, and bergamot, delivering a fresh, slightly juicy citrus brightness. The heart develops into suede, sandalwood, and subtle pink berries, adding a soft leathery texture with creamy woody depth. The base settles into vanilla, white musk, birch, and ambergris, creating a smooth, musky, and slightly smoky finish that feels elegant and long-lasting. Meringue is perfect for women who enjoy clean yet slightly leathery woody fragrances with a soft musky sweetness.",
